  {
   "say": "Number four. On May fifteenth, nineteen oh five, a railroad land auction founded the town.",
   "cap": "Number four.|On May 15, 1905,|a railroad land auction|founded the town.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Its springs made it a handy place for trains to stop for water in the desert.",
   "cap": "Its springs made it|a handy place for trains|to stop for water|in the desert.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Number three. In nineteen thirty one, Nevada made gambling legal again.",
   "cap": "Number three.|In 1931, Nevada|made gambling legal again.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "That year, the first gaming license in Clark County went to the Northern Club.",
   "cap": "That year, the first|gaming license in Clark County|went to the Northern Club.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Number two. A giant dam was being built nearby, and the workers poured in.",
   "cap": "Number two.|A giant dam|was being built nearby,|and the workers poured in.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "More than forty two thousand unemployed workers came, hoping for one of five thousand jobs.",
   "cap": "More than 42,000|unemployed workers came,|hoping for one|of 5,000 jobs.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "And number one. In nineteen forty one, El Rancho Vegas opened on Highway ninety one.",
   "cap": "And number one.|In 1941, El Rancho Vegas|opened on Highway 91.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "It was the first resort on what became the Strip. The Flamingo followed in nineteen forty six.",
   "cap": "It was the first resort|on what became the Strip.|The Flamingo followed|in 1946.",
